  "content": "<h1>肮脏的东西</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fbPSeyZT7xS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(“链接”部分中的discord链接或点击此处)</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>此模组添加了基于烟草的产品。<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/2NPPfx4/cigarette.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"360\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gmMDw83/cigar.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p>你可以在平原村庄的宝箱中找到烟草种子。<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jbw6WBp/seeds.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p>你可以将收获的作物放在晾衣架上晾干。<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/M5R6TVh/drying-rack.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<p>你可以与农民村民交易烟草叶包裹。<br><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4gtMF8R/trading.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"639\" height=\"360\"></p>\n<h1>计划中</h1>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li>JEI兼容性</li>\n<li>更多种类的香烟</li>\n<li>电子烟</li>\n<li>鼻烟</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>图片</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/775/smoking.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/769/crops.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/770/drying.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/771/seeds.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/772/trading.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p>旧版模组页面 (2.1)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>此模组添加了基于烟草的产品。你可以从流浪商人那里获得烟草种子。你可以将收获的作物晾干，并从中制作雪茄/香烟。普通的雪茄/香烟会给予几秒钟的抗性提升效果，随后会给予缓慢效果。你可以向农民村民交易烟草叶以及烟草以换取绿宝石。在制作雪茄/香烟时加入花朵，会产生类似于可疑炖汤的效果。</p>\n<h1>2.1 更新</h1>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:90%;border-width:1px;border-color:#ECF0F1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\">花朵</th>\n<th style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">效果</th>\n<th style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">副作用</th>\n<th style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">效果持续时间</th>\n<th style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">副作用持续时间</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/2/2a/Allium_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">大花葱</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">防火</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">发光</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">15秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">5秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/1/1a/Azure_Bluet_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">蓝花矢车菊</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">失明</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">夜视</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">5秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">20秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/3/33/Blue_Orchid_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">蓝色兰花<br><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/2/24/Dandelion_JE8_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">蒲公英</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">饱和度</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">饥饿</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">0.2秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">5秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/7/73/Cornflower_JE1_BE1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">矢车菊</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">跳跃提升</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">缓慢</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">15秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">5秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/6/60/Lily_of_the_Valley_JE1_BE1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">铃兰</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">中毒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">生命恢复</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">5秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">20秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/d/d1/Oxeye_Daisy_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">雏菊</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">生命恢复</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">中毒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">15秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">5秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/3/3b/Poppy_JE8_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">虞美人<br><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/3/36/Torchflower_Age_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">火把花</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">夜视</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">失明</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">15秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">5秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/6/6a/White_Tulip_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/c/c0/Pink_Tulip_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/4/4a/Orange_Tulip_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/c/c7/Red_Tulip_JE7_BE2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">郁金香</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">虚弱</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">力量</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">5秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">20秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:20.5469%\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/f/fa/Wither_Rose_JE1_BE1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\">凋零玫瑰</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.6719%\">凋零</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:17.0878%\">抗性提升</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:18.7203%\">5秒</td>\n<td style=\"border-width:1px;border-color:rgb(236, 240, 241);width:24.7252%\">20秒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1>图片</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/866/934/crafting_recipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/52/workstation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/866/919/villager_trading.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/51/tobacco_crop.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
